<% content_for :title, "Privacy policy" %>
<section class="card prose">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p>Auto Pool Temp is a small personal project run by <%= SmsProgram::SENDER %>. This policy covers the app and its
    text alerts (<%= link_to SmsProgram::NAME, sms_path %>).</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your email address and password (stored encrypted) to sign in.</li>
    <li>Your pool's location (a ZIP code or map point) to get the weather forecast.</li>
    <li>Your pool settings, and readings you send us, such as the water temperature.</li>
    <li>If you choose text alerts: your mobile number, when you agreed to receive messages, and the messages sent and
      received.</li>
    <li>If you choose Telegram alerts: your Telegram chat ID.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>Only to run the app: to plan your pool's heater settings and send you the alerts you asked for.</p>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p><strong>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional
    purposes.</strong> Text messaging opt-in data and consent will not be shared with any third parties. We don't sell
    any information. Messages are delivered through our providers (Twilio for text messages, Telegram for Telegram
    messages), which handle them only to deliver them. Weather forecasts come from Open-Meteo using your pool's location.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Reply STOP to any text to stop text messages.</li>
    <li>Change or remove your phone number in Settings at any time.</li>
    <li>To have your account and data deleted, email <%= SmsProgram::CONTACT_EMAIL %>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><%= SmsProgram::SENDER %>, <%= SmsProgram::CONTACT_EMAIL %></p>
  <p class="muted">Last updated October 5, 2026.</p>
</section>
